          "observation": "There is no maximum on steps, runtime, retries, or sub agents, and sub agents can spawn their own researchers."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes:3",
          "observation": "About 3 percent of 40,000 rows have malformed names that never return a complete result, so repeated retries have a stable failure set."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes:2",
          "observation": "enrich.lookup is billed per call and uses a shared API key and monthly quota that also supports sales and marketing tools."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes:4",
          "observation": "There is no spend alert on the enrichment account."
        }
